# The image's build context, as an allow-list: only what the image needs is sent to Docker, so nothing personal
# (data/ with your settings, keys, memory and logs; .venv/; .git/) can slip in, however the folder grows.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!orion/
!docker/
# The four starter skills that ship with Orion (tracked in git), and none of the skills you or he made.
!data/skills/deep-research/
!data/skills/morning-briefing/
!data/skills/pc-checkup/
!data/skills/play-music/

# Never, even inside the folders above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[codz]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
